"    添加中文省份数据\n"
"\n"
"    增加小企业会计科目表\n"
"\n"
"    修改小企业会计科目表\n"
"\n"
"    修改小企业会计税率\n"
"\n"
"    增加大企业会计科目表\n"
"\n"
"We added the option to print a voucher which will also\n"
"print the amount in words (special Chinese characters for numbers)\n"
"correctly when the cn2an library is installed. (e.g. with pip3 install cn2an)\n"
